  "description": "Built for the streets, boardwalks, and bike paths of Huntington Beach, the SKULLXBONES® Women's Beach Cruiser is the ultimate single-speed cruiser for riders who want style, comfort, and zero fuss. The custom pedal-forward ergonomic frame puts you in a natural, upright riding position — so every ride feels effortless from the first pedal stroke. Simple coaster brake, classic cruiser geometry, and premium components throughout.Wide 26\" x 50mm aluminum wheels with black stainless spokes resist corrosion and look sharp. The HBBC gel comfort seat keeps you riding mile after mile in total comfort. At HBBC, we take making the best beach cruiser bikes for women seriously — designing and manufacturing every product with quality and comfort as our top priority.Customize your ride with our bike accessories, or go further with our Electric Beach Cruisers.HBBC… Style Matters… Ride With Us!!Check out the entire SKULLXBONES® family of cruisers! Visit our flagship store — HB Easyrider at 328 Main Street in Downtown Huntington Beach!🛠️ Specs",
